# the delay's TIME: a note value a click (1/8 -> 1/4T -> 1/8D -> 1/4 -> 1/4D, the last held), each the middle of its
# division (fx.h fx_delay_div, fx_delay_at: 1/4 and 1/4D share the old tenth of 1/4); the knob prints the note, and
# what plays where the line halves it
wait 300
tap GLO
turn SELECT 1
wait 40
expect page FX_I
expect par11.camt 83
turn K1 1
wait 40
expect par11.camt 97
turn K1 1
turn K1 1
turn K1 1
wait 40
expect par11.camt 124
turn K1 -1
wait 40
expect par11.camt 118
expect epar11.camt 118
bpm 80
wait 40
shot delaytime_80bpm.png
